    dct:description "Pass 1 baseline validates claim T1917-028 on a CC section image with radial shell sampling and log-spiral OLS; `--pass1` skips center refinement and multi-regime panel. Overall 56.3/100 (faithfulness 50.1, reproducibility 70.8); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit HEAD; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 68, Morphological realism / specimen match 42, Parameter expressivity 38, Morphometric validation 48, Source and data traceability 78, Code-to-model traceability 60, Reproducibility package 72. Output judged: docs/media/t1917_028_the_logarithmic_spiral_comparison.png: rendered output of thompson/claims/t1917-028_the-logarithmic-spiral.py at HEAD, image/png, 255011 B, 1500×750 px, artifact_sha256 4a85223c5be4aa90d890fface68fca216b0593b9af6455bf7f6c35cb3da21857 (sha256 4a85223c5be4aa90d890fface68fca216b0593b9af6455bf7f6c35cb3da21857), spec_fingerprint 08a1c83cf7770b52575a4e508d980714ec0f1886be1762236a3a8e784f1ff175. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 08a1c83cf7770b52575a4e508d980714ec0f1886be1762236a3a8e784f1ff175; artifact_sha256: 4a85223c5be4aa90d890fface68fca216b0593b9af6455bf7f6c35cb3da21857. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Thompson (1917) Ch. XI diagrams septa meeting the whorl wall and evolute/involute relations for Nautilus; reconstructed_in_script: Equiangular spiral r=r0 exp(kθ), whorl ratio W, septum involute overlay, wall meeting complement β=90°−ψ; transfer_boundary: Commons section photo is N. pompilius; Thompson figures are schematic radiograph-style diagrams; does_not_claim: Full 3D CT chamber hydrodynamics or Raup (D,T) helicospiral surface mesh." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Cross-reference Lean theorems (Loop_222) in function docstrings and verify with `lean morphoeval/lean/loops/Thompson1917_T1917_028.lean` when toolchain present.",
        "remediation needed: Enable full Pass 2 mode: center grid refinement, 3-regime sweep panel, Archimedean ablation bars, beta-angle CV, and result.json verdict with W_median vs literature 2.85.",
        "remediation needed: Expand self_test to verify SHA-256, log-spiral beats Archimedean on specimen envelope, and bitwise measure_morphoeval parity." ;
